	// ErrorTypeForbidden is used to report valid (as per formatting rules)
	// values which would be accepted under some con
ROOT CAUSE: The bug occurred because the metav1.CauseType constants did not fully correspond to the ErrorType constants in the validation field package. This mismatch caused incomplete or incorrect mapping between the two error representations. The underlying cause is that metav1.CauseType was missing several values present in ErrorType, leading to inconsistent error handling or reporting.
